Reason: The native runner fires both sides of a colliding pair back to back. Here each side waited for its own turn, and a self that destroyed itself in its handler was skipped by the other's: AM2R's missile explodes on the Alpha Metroid (its own collision event) and the Alpha's damage event never ran, so no one could get past the first Metroid (beta 0.14.0).
Upstream: Engine bug on every platform (0011's early break made no difference: the other's turn skipped the destroyed self anyway) - to offer upstream with 0011. Retires this patch when merged.

